-1\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f74af78814931ea0\" href=\"?note=f74af78814931ea0\" title=\"./18-df-restricted-foundation\">18-df-restricted-foundation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.6 (TranC); §12.1 immediately before Definition 12.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"261, 298"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"270, 306"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited record; not a new source check"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是纯集合论语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\in,=\\}\">\\(\\{\\in,=\\}\\)</span> 加常元集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的语言，不增添关系或函数符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 和变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 在下式定义；项的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 取当前签名的变量接口，允许常元作参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}&#39;,\\mathrm{Null}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}&#39;,\\mathrm{Null}\\)</span> 与公式缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a> 的精确公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Found}_*\">\\(\\mathrm{Found}_*\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f74af78814931ea0\" href=\"?note=f74af78814931ea0\" title=\"./18-df-restricted-foundation\">18-df-restricted-foundation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{TranC},\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{KP}^{\\mathrm r}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{TranC},\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{KP}^{\\mathrm r}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是下式引入的公理模式、句子和理论。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^*F\">\\(\\forall^*F\\)</span> 表示按固定变量枚举对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 全部自由变量的全称闭包。各模式只取 Assertion 中列出的变量互异及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\">\\(z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\)</span> 条件，不进行隐含改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a> 在当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 上的接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 的变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 和枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TranC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TranC}\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 固定取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0,w_1,w_2\">\\(w_0,w_1,w_2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\\)</span> 使用上游在当前常元扩张中的模板；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Found}_*\">\\(\\mathrm{Found}_*\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f74af78814931ea0\" href=\"?note=f74af78814931ea0\" title=\"18-df-restricted-foundation\">18-df-restricted-foundation</a> 在同一签名中的实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall F,G\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n[\\neg F\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\land G)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\lor G)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\to G)\\in\\mathcal C]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall F\\in\\mathcal C\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n[x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\to\n(((\\forall x\\in t)F)\\in\\mathcal C\\land((\\exists x\\in t)F)\\in\\mathcal C)]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall F,G\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n[\\neg F\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\land G)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\lor G)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\to G)\\in\\mathcal C]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall F\\in\\mathcal C\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n[x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\to\n(((\\forall x\\in t)F)\\in\\mathcal C\\land((\\exists x\\in t)F)\\in\\mathcal C)]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall^*\\exists z\\forall x\\;[x\\in z\\leftrightarrow(x\\in u\\land F)]:\nF\\in\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L),\\ x,u,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L},\\ |\\{x,u,z\\}|=3,\\ z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall^*((\\forall x\\in u\\;\\exists y\\;F)\\to\\exists z\\;\\forall x\\in u\\;\\exists y\\in z\\;F):\nF\\in\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L),\\ x,y,u,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L},\\ |\\{x,y,u,z\\}|=4,\\ z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TranC}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\exists y\\,[\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\\land\\forall z\\,(z\\in x\\to z\\in y)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}&#39;,\\mathrm{Null},\\mathrm{TranC}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{KP}^{\\mathrm r}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Found}_*\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall^*\\exists z\\forall x\\;[x\\in z\\leftrightarrow(x\\in u\\land F)]:\nF\\in\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L),\\ x,u,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L},\\ |\\{x,u,z\\}|=3,\\ z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall^*((\\forall x\\in u\\;\\exists y\\;F)\\to\\exists z\\;\\forall x\\in u\\;\\exists y\\in z\\;F):\nF\\in\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L),\\ x,y,u,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L},\\ |\\{x,y,u,z\\}|=4,\\ z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TranC}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\exists y\\,[\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\\land\\forall z\\,(z\\in x\\to z\\in y)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}&#39;,\\mathrm{Null},\\mathrm{TranC}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{KP}^{\\mathrm r}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Found}_*\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.298 明确在 BST 中删除基础模式，并以 (TranC) 替换 (Union')；随后定义 KP⁻ 与 KPʳ。本节取该无无穷公理的版本，不是 p.261 另加 (Inf') 的 BST⁻ω。(TranC) 是存在传递上界的公理，不能在缺少基础模式时只删掉 (FOUND) 却默认仍能构造传递包。</p>\n<p>所有模式都给出语法索引集；在纯集合论语言加常元的范围内，常元只是公式参数实例，不引入关于新谓词的隐含理解模式。下游若引入 Ad 等新谓词，须另行明确模式范围，不能直接假定本节已经覆盖该扩张。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-restricted-foundation","status":"resolved","id":"f74af78814931ea0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-restricted-foundation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是纯集合论语言 $\\{\\in,=\\}$ 加常元集 $C$ 的语言，不增添关系或函数符号；$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}$、$\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}$、$\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}$ 和变量集 $\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}$ 取 [[./18-df-formula]] 的语法。$\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)$ 在下式定义；项的 $\\mathrm{FV}$ 取当前签名的变量接口，允许常元作参数。","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}',\\mathrm{Null}$ 与公式缩写 $\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)$ 取 [[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]] 的精确公式。$\\mathrm{Found}_*$ 取 [[./18-df-restricted-foundation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-restricted-foundation","status":"resolved","id":"f74af78814931ea0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}',\\mathrm{Null}$ 与公式缩写 $\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)$ 取 [[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]] 的精确公式。$\\mathrm{Found}_*$ 取 [[./18-df-restricted-foundation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\forall^*F$ 表示按固定变量枚举对 $F$ 全部自由变量的全称闭包。各模式只取 Assertion 中列出的变量互异及 $z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)$ 条件，不进行隐含改名。$\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ}$ 是 [[18-df-free-variable]] 在当前 $\\mathcal L$ 上的接口。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-restricted-foundation","status":"resolved","id":"f74af78814931ea0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 保留 $\\mathcal L_\\in$ 的变量集 $W$ 和枚举；$\\mathrm{TranC}$ 中的 $x,y,z$ 固定取 $w_0,w_1,w_2$。$\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)$ 使用上游在当前常元扩张中的模板；$\\mathrm{Found}_*$ 使用 [[18-df-restricted-foundation]] 在同一签名中的实例。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\in,=\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}',\\mathrm{Null}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Found}_*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{TranC},\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{KP}^{\\mathrm r}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^*F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TranC}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"w_0,w_1,w_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Found}_*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}:\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&\\land\\ \\forall F,G\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n[\\neg F\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\land G)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\lor G)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(F\\to G)\\in\\mathcal C]\\\\\n&\\land\\ \\forall F\\in\\mathcal C\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n[x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\to\n(((\\forall x\\in t)F)\\in\\mathcal C\\land((\\exists x\\in t)F)\\in\\mathcal C)]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall^*\\exists z\\forall x\\;[x\\in z\\leftrightarrow(x\\in u\\land F)]:\nF\\in\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L),\\ x,u,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L},\\ |\\{x,u,z\\}|=3,\\ z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall^*((\\forall x\\in u\\;\\exists y\\;F)\\to\\exists z\\;\\forall x\\in u\\;\\exists y\\in z\\;F):\nF\\in\\Delta_0(\\mathcal L),\\ x,y,u,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L},\\ |\\{x,y,u,z\\}|=4,\\ z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TranC}&\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\exists y\\,[\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(y)\\land\\forall z\\,(z\\in x\\to z\\in y)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{Pair}',\\mathrm{Null},\\mathrm{TranC}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sep}_0(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{BST}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\mathrm{Coll}_0(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{KP}^{\\mathrm r}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Found}_*\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4991,"backlinks":[{"id":"5dd0384f81f0e316","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\notin C$ 是全新常元，$F^U$ 及 $T^U$ 是 [[./18-df-relativization]] 的捕获规避相对化。$\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}}$ 取 [[./18-df-kp-minus]]，$\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)$ 取 [[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-kp-minus]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-kp-minus]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-kp-minus]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-kp-minus|18-df-kp-minus]]"}],"outgoing":["e391b202f09e2f43","2718a8a11c383b33","f74af78814931ea0","0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","d6572d061e706d93"]}